Rewritten against the new merge queue settings routes under /orgs/{owner}/repositories/{repository}/merge-queue/ (the /repos/ ones are deprecated). The branch level is now mergify_branch_pattern_merge_queue_settings with a branch_pattern argument, like the API; the data source's source carries branch_pattern. The PUT's answer is stored instead of a second GET. MERGE_QUEUE_SETTING_TOO_MANY_BRANCH_PATTERNS gets its own diagnostic, and batch_pull_request uses the API schema's current text.
